{"id": "86360", "name": "הופכית של מטריצה 3×3 או קביעה שאינה הפיכה – כאן הפיכה (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Let \\({\\bf A}\\) be the matrix</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\\[{\\bf A}={{CT:0}}\\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>Find the inverse of \\({\\bf A}\\), if it is invertible. If \\({\\bf A}\\) is not invertible, return the zero matrix \\({\\bf O}\\).</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\( {\\bf A}^{-1} = \\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p class=\"input-hint input-hint-grid\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:left\">How to enter: each entry in its own box: a number, a fraction (e.g. <code dir=\"ltr\">1/2</code>) or an expression (e.g. <code dir=\"ltr\">sqrt(2)</code>).</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>Augment matrix \\({\\bf A}\\) with a 3 by 3 identity matrix:</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\\[{{CT:1}}\\]</p><p>There is +1 in the upper left-hand corner so create 0's below it by adding \\({{CT:2}}\\) times row 1 to row 2 and \\({{CT:3}}\\) times row 1 to row 3</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\\[{{CT:4}}\\]</p><p>Now there is +1 in entry [2,2] of the matrix so create 0's above and below it by adding \\({{CT:5}}\\) times row 2 to row 1 and \\({{CT:6}}\\) times row 2 to row 3</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\\[{{CT:7}}\\]</p><p>Now there is +1 in entry [3,3] of the matrix so create 0's above it by adding \\({{CT:8}}\\) times row 3 to row 1 and \\({{CT:9}}\\) times row 3 to row 2</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\\[{{CT:10}}\\]</p><p>The left half of this matrix is the identity matrix and the right half is the inverse of \\({\\bf A}\\)</p><p>Therefore</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\\[{\\bf A^{-1}} = {{CT:11}}\\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "determinant, invert", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "correctanswer", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "wronganswer1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">This is the original matrix. You need to invert it, if possible!</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "Result-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "wronganswer2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">The matrix \\({\\bf A}\\) is invertible.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "Result-2-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 3, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "wronganswer3", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-3-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">This is the identity matrix.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-3-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["auga", "correctanswer", "matrixa", "matrixb", "matrixc", "mr1", "mr3", "mro1", "mro2", "mrow2", "mrow3", "temp1", "temp2", "temp3", "wronganswer1", "wronganswer2", "wronganswer3"], "nvariants": 50}